betaLogin.title = Enter your password
betaLogin.heading = Enter your password
betaLogin.paragraph1 = The Senior Accounting Officer notification and certificate service is in private beta. You’ll need a password to access it.
betaLogin.paragraph2 = You should have received this in your welcome pack.
betaLogin.paragraph3 = If you believe you should have access to this service, you can:
betaLogin.subheading = If you have not received a password
betaLogin.bulletPoint1 = check your spam or junk folder for an email from your HMRC contact
betaLogin.bulletPoint2 = email your HMRC contact to request a password
betaLogin.error.passwordMismatch = Enter a valid password
betaLogin.error.required = Enter a password

